```console
$ scrapmf --help
Safe, interactive archiver for social media galleries

Usage: scrapmf [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  scrape  Scrape a URL using the configured backend
  config  Manage configuration
  doctor  Check backends and system
  setup   Install the bundled pinned gallery-dl backend
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -v, --verbose...  Increase verbosity (-v, -vv)
  -h, --help        Print help
  -V, --version     Print version

```

```console
$ scrapmf --version
scrapmf [..]

```
